        "created_at": "2018-03-30T13:04:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can agree. I have found a workaround for the maps but getting&nbsp;more fear and energy would be nice. I am one of those players&nbsp;that like the little bits, preferring&nbsp;that over dice.</p><p>I know this is supposed&nbsp;to be a holdover for the next expansion but who knows when it will&nbsp;get here. (I assume a kick starter after the RPG Kickstarter, saying nothing of when Prime wars will be Kickstarter again.)</p><p>Also, the map is also hard to read so I get a huge headache afterward.</p>",
