      {
        "id": 215751,
        "name": "jffdougan",
        "username": "jffdougan",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/{size}/1882_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-07T01:35:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's been stated in other threads, either here or elsewhere or both, that design goals for the expansion being designed include:</p><ul>\n<li>Support for 5-6 players</li>\n<li>Ability to have at least some content used with the core game only, and without the existing Branch &amp; Claw expansion</li>\n<li>More of everything already existing in the game - Spirits, Powers, Adversaries, Scenarios.</li>\n<li>In addition, the currently existing playmat has symbols for two types of tokens that do not exist in Branch &amp; Claw. It can be reasonably surmised that the forthcoming expansion is a logical place to introduce those.</li>\n</ul>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:47:16.277Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
