        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It&#39;s been stated in other threads, either here or elsewhere or both, that design goals for the expansion being designed include:</p><ul><li>Support for 5-6 players</li><li>Ability to have at least some content used with the core game only, and without the existing Branch &amp; Claw expansion</li><li>More of everything already existing in the game - Spirits, Powers, Adversaries, Scenarios.</li><li>In addition, the currently existing playmat has symbols for two types of tokens that do not exist in Branch &amp; Claw. It can be reasonably surmised that the forthcoming expansion is a logical place to introduce those.</li></ul>",
