        "created_at": "2018-05-08T00:36:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As someone who has played lots of five players, the map is just fine.&nbsp; You are a bit more isolated but with some teamwork, people can help you out. I would definitely&nbsp;no recommend for the first few games. 6 players is just fine, a lot on the board but if everyone chip in and take cares of there board everything is ok.<br><br>&nbsp;</p>",
